		*m: searchnow
		*p: closeaddr
		*p: csearchtable		&& Parameter, name of table to searc.
		*p: nconnhandle
		*p: ngridrow		&& Selected Grid Row
		*p: nreturnkey		&& Holds Key to Return in Unload event.
		*p: tablename
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

	*<PropValue>
		Icon = graphics\earth.ico
		AlwaysOnTop = .T.
		AutoCenter = .T.
		Caption = "Search Table:"
